(slower-b747-sv01-rectangle-course-6dof)
*title B747 closed rectangular waypoint course with elevated corner
*mode rigid-body-6dof
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*runtime status vehicle reference-area=510.96672 reference-length=8.324088 dry-mass-kg=288756.9 inertia-x=24675886.7 inertia-y=44877574.1 inertia-z=67384152.0 envelope-min-forward-speed=20 envelope-max-mach=0.9 envelope-max-alpha-deg=4 envelope-max-beta-deg=5 aero-alpha-reference-deg=3.1
*runtime control elevator-deg vehicle=1 default=0.3861602391 lower=-10 upper=10
*runtime status target latitude-deg=0.0 longitude-deg=0.0 altitude-m=100.0
*runtime status route mode=rectangle start-latitude-deg=0.0 start-longitude-deg=0.0 duration-s=320.0 start-altitude-m=100.0 rectangle-length-m=12000 rectangle-width-m=12000 elevated-corner-altitude-m=200 rectangle-speed-mps=153.0 rectangle-corner-window-s=75.0 rectangle-bank-deg=20 position-capture-gain=0.0
*runtime status guidance propnav-gain=0.0 rectangle-coordinated-turn=false attitude-gain=200000.0 rate-damping=5000000.0 max-sideslip-deg=4.0 alpha-hold-gain-deg-per-deg=-0.2 alpha-hold-target-deg=3.1 rectangle-lift-compensation-deg=2.0 elevator-min-deg=-10 elevator-max-deg=10
*runtime status actuator maximum-moment=100000000 maximum-body-rate-deg-s=30
*runtime lqr attitude states=attitude-error-x,attitude-error-y,attitude-error-z,wx,wy,wz controls=moment-x,moment-y,moment-z q-angle=4.0 q-rate=1.0 r-moment=0.25 method=continuous update=initial
*runtime status thermal policy=none
*trajectory 1 b747 start on 1
  *initial ecic x=6378237.0 y=0.0 z=0.0 xdt=0.0 ydt=153.0096 zdt=0.0 qw=0.5115355557 qx=-0.5115355557 qy=-0.4881919451 qz=0.4881919451 time=0.0 mass=288756.9 propellant_mass=0.0
  *segment 1 rectangle
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.02
    *prop thrust=179539.8975191153 mdot=0
    *aero cx=(cx) cy=(cy) cz=(cz) cmx=(cmx) cmy=(cmy) cmz=(cmz)
    *fly propnav=4
    *when time>320.0 stop
*end
